Package: cinminai-llama
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libgomp1, libvulkan1
Suggests: cinminai-llama-cuda
Description: llama.cpp for the Cin-MinAI assistant (processor and Vulkan)
 The pinned llama.cpp release (llama-server) that runs the assistant's model on
 this computer. One build, with the backends as modules loaded at start: the
 processor (a module per instruction-set level, the best one is picked for the
 running CPU) and Vulkan (AMD and Intel graphics). NVIDIA's CUDA module is in
 cinminai-llama-cuda. Nothing here downloads or sends anything; the assistant
 starts it and talks to it over a private socket. How it was built:
 /usr/share/doc/cinminai-llama/BUILDINFO.
